    "title": "Who from City of Newark area's former high school standouts will be active on Saturday, Dec. 13? - Newark Reporter",
    "text": "These ex-City of Newark area high school standouts will participate in competitions on Saturday, Dec. 13.\nAnthony Akande\nGoldey-Beacom Lightning\nGuard\nSophomore\n6′5″ 185\nArts High School\nHometown: Newark\nNext Game: vs. Felician Golden Falcons, Saturday, Dec. 13, 3 p.m.\nKhalid Bakare\nTCNJ Lions\nForward and guard\nJunior\n6′5″ 195\nSt. Benedict’s Preparatory School\nHometown: Newark\nNext Game: vs. Ramapo Roadrunners, Saturday, Dec. 13, 3 p.m.\nLadji Dembele\nUNLV Rebels\nForward\nJunior\n6′8″ 255\nSt. Benedict’s Preparatory School\nHometown: Newark\nNext Game: vs. Tennessee State Tigers, Saturday, Dec. 13, 6 p.m.\nSamir Wilkins\nVillanova Wildcats\nFreshman\n5′11″ 170\nMalcolm X. Shabazz High School\nHometown: Newark\nNext Game: vs. Tarleton State Texans, Saturday, Dec. 13, 12 p.m.",
